A number triangle T(n,k) read by rows for 0<=k<=n, related to the Taylor expansion of f(u, p) = (1/2)*(1+1/(sqrt(1-u^2)))*exp(p*sqrt(1-u^2)).

The 45 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A305402

